title: CompanionRecruitment_Mara
---
<<declare $mara_loyalty = 0>>
<<declare $mara_synergy_rank = 0>>
<<declare $mara_personal_quest_stage = 0>>
<<declare $mara_trust_earned = false>>

=== mara_recruitment_immediate ===
MARA: *smiling, vines retracting* "The Green remembers. The Chrome forgets."

KAEL-7: "Walker. This is contamination. Return to the Purified fold."

MARA: "They're *awake*, Kael. Let them choose."

She takes your hand—warm, bark-textured. "The Grove is close. We'll cleanse the cryo-sickness. *Naturally*."

*   "Lead the way." -> mara_lead_way
*   "What's happening to me?" -> mara_whats_happening
*   "The Signal... it's loud." -> mara_signal_loud

=== mara_lead_way ===
MARA: "Good. The deep paths are faster. Less Rust. More... *alive*."

<<set $mara_loyalty = $mara_loyalty + 5>>

-> exit_with_mara

=== mara_whats_happening ===
MARA: "You're *adapting*. Three centuries of Signal exposure in cryo. Your DNA is... singing. We'll harmonize it."

<<set $mara_loyalty = $mara_loyalty + 3>>

-> exit_with_mara

=== mara_signal_loud ===
MARA: *serious* "Loud means Oracle is *calling*. Sector Zero is waking up. So is everything else."

<<set $mara_loyalty = $mara_loyalty + 2>>

-> exit_with_mara

=== exit_with_mara ===
KAEL-7: "A mistake. The Rooted cannot protect what they refuse to purge."

He transmits something. "Purified Command. Walker recovered. Rooted interference. Requesting extraction team."

Mara's vines spike. "Threats now, Kael? After three centuries?"

*Tension. They part ways—hostile.*

Mara guides you through maintenance tunnels into **The Grove**—a cavern turned forest. Bioluminescent. Breathing.

*Tutorial: Grove Systems unlocked*
-> grove_tutorial

=== mara_personal_quest_1 ===
*Available at Loyalty 100 (Ally)*

MARA kneels at a Communion Pool. Water glows emerald. Vines pulse around her arms.

MARA: "Walker. The Grove sings for you. One of our Heart-Trees... it's dying. The Rust has taken root in its core."

*   "A Heart-Tree?" -> mara_quest_1_heart_tree
*   "Can I help?" -> mara_quest_1_help
*   "Not my problem." -> mara_quest_1_decline

=== mara_quest_1_heart_tree ===
MARA: "The oldest of the Grove. Planted from a seed of the World-Tree. It holds the memories of every Rooted who communed here. If it dies... we lose our history. Our *selves*."

*   "I'll help." -> mara_quest_1_accept
*   "Too dangerous." -> mara_quest_1_decline

=== mara_quest_1_help ===
MARA: "Your Signal can cleanse the corruption. But you'll have to enter the Dreaming Roots. Face the memories. *All* of them."

*   "I'll help." -> mara_quest_1_accept
*   "Too dangerous." -> mara_quest_1_decline

=== mara_quest_1_accept ===
<<set $mara_personal_quest_stage = 1>>
<<set $mara_loyalty = $mara_loyalty + 10>>

MARA: *eyes glowing* "Then we descend. The Dreaming Roots wait in the Deep Grove. Three sectors east."

*Quest Started: **Rooted Memory** — Cleanse the Heart-Tree in the Deep Grove.*

-> mara_quest_1_briefing

=== mara_quest_1_decline ===
MARA: *shoulders slump* "The Green does not force. But... the Choir will remember this choice."

The loyalty meter drops.

<<set $mara_loyalty = $mara_loyalty - 15>>

-> mara_quest_1_end

=== mara_quest_1_briefing ===
MARA: "The Deep Grove is... intense. The Rust there is sentient. Hungry. We'll need anti-corruption serum from the Communion Pool. And your Resonance."

*   "Let's go." -> mara_quest_1_depart
*   "Prepare first." -> mara_quest_1_prepare

=== mara_quest_1_depart ===
MARA: "Good. We leave at moonrise. The Roots are most receptive then."

*Quest Active. Travel to Sector 11: Deep Grove.*
-> mara_quest_1_end

=== mara_quest_1_prepare ===
MARA: "Wise. The Communion Pool can grant a mutation for the journey. The Vats grow living armor. Choose your symbiont."

*Free to explore Grove before departure.*
-> mara_quest_1_end

=== mara_quest_1_end ===
=== end ===

=== grove_tutorial ===
*GROVE SYSTEMS*

**Biomass Vats:** Grow consumables, mutations, living gear
**Communion Pool:** Spend Resonance Fragments for mutations
**Root Network:** Fast travel between discovered Groves
**Symbiosis Shrine:** Bond with companions, unlock combos

MARA: "Sleep in the canopy. Dream Green. Wake changed."

-> act1_begin